Dialogue: 2,0:21:25.65,0:21:30.65,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Darkness comes like a fire
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.96,0:21:37.06,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Draped in gold my ever desire
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.85,0:21:43.60,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Beelzebub done signed my name, I'm on his mind
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.38,0:21:49.38,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Gave me everything but my heart's desire
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.24,0:21:56.10,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}He came in like a flood
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.71,0:22:03.26,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Fire blazing, hotter than the sun
Dialogue: 2,0:22:03.83,0:22:09.46,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}I done drowned in the flames far from the shore
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.40,0:22:15.97,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Ain't nothing else could help so I done begged for more
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.92,0:22:24.39,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Can't turn back, I'm yours now
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.12,0:22:30.28,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Ain't letting go we made a vow
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.88,0:22:38.08,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Sun will rise, dark will fall
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.08,0:22:44.37,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Feet don't fail me now
Dialogue: 2,0:22:53.61,0:22:57.36,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Whatever my lot
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.76,0:23:10.06,ED-EN,,0,30,55,,{\fad(350,350)\an9\fs54\shad0}Whatever my lot
